<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TokoKLONTONG - Informasi & Layanan Toko</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #059669;
            --primary-light: #D1FAE5;
            --dark: #1E293B;
            --light: #F8FAFC;
            --gray: #64748B;
            --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--light);
            color: var(--dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: white;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .navbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* HERO INFORMASI */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #047857 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .badge-status {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #10B981;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* SECTION STYLES */
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        /* GRID INFORMASI & KEUNGGULAN */
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            border-top: 4px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .info-list {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .info-list li {
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #E2E8F0;
            padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .info-list li strong {
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        /* KEUNGGULAN TOKO */
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .feature-item {
            background: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .feature-item h4 {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--dark);
        }

        .feature-item p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--gray);
        }

        /* TOMBOL WA */
        .btn-wa {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #25D366;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            width: 100%;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-wa:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .nav-links { display: none; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- NAVBAR -->
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar">
            <a href="#" class="logo">Toko<span>KLONTONG</span></a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#profil">Profil</a></li>
                <li><a href="#jam-operasional">Jam Buka</a></li>
                <li><a href="#layanan">Layanan</a></li>
                <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero" id="profil">
        <h1>TokoKLONTONG Dekat & Lengkap</h1>
        <p>Mitra terpercaya kebutuhan harian keluarga Anda. Menyediakan sembako, bumbu dapur, barang kebutuhan rumah tangga, hingga pulsa.</p>
        <span class="badge-status">● Buka Hari Ini</span>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTENT CONTAINER -->
    <main class="container">
        
        <!-- INFORMASI UTAMA TOKO -->
        <div class="info-grid">
            
            <!-- CARD JAM OPERASIONAL -->
            <div class="card" id="jam-operasional">
                <h3>Jam Operasional</h3>
                <ul class="info-list">
                    <li><span>Senin - Jumat</span> <strong>06:00 - 21:00 WIB</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Sabtu</span> <strong>06:00 - 21:00 WIB</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Minggu</span> <strong>07:00 - 20:00 WIB</strong></li>
                    <li><span>Hari Libur Nasional</span> <strong>Tetap Buka</strong></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- CARD ALAMAT & KONTAK -->
            <div class="card" id="kontak">
                <h3>Informasi Kontak</h3>
                <p><strong>Alamat:</strong><br>Jl. Raya Utama No. 45, RT 02/RW 05, Surabaya</p>
                <br>
                <p><strong>Pemesanan Cepat:</strong></p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890" target="_blank" class="btn-wa"> Hubungi via WhatsApp</a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- KEUNGGULAN LAYANAN -->
        <h2 class="section-title" id="layanan">Layanan Kami</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-item">
                <h4>Sembako Lengkap</h4>
                <p>Beras, minyak, gula, telur, hingga bumbu dapur selalu tersedia dan segar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
                <h4>Pesan-Antar Lokal</h4>
                <p>Khusus area sekitar toko, belanjaan bisa diantar langsung ke rumah.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
                <h4>Pembayaran Digital</h4>
                <p>Menerima pembayaran tunai, QRIS, Transfer Bank, dan e-Wallet.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
                <h4>Layanan PPOB</h4>
                <p>Melayani pengisian pulsa, paket data, serta pembayaran listrik PLN & PDAM.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 TokoKLONTONG - Melayani Sepenuh Hati.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
